*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0035.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0035C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 OVERLIMIT-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM EXCESS-TXN-FEE
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "OVERLIMIT-FEE=" OVERLIMIT-FEE
    STOP RUN.
EXCESS-TXN-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 10
        COMPUTE OVERLIMIT-FEE = (MONTHLY-TXNS - 10) * 0.50
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B' AND MONTHLY-TXNS > 40
        ADD 25 TO OVERLIMIT-FEE
    END-IF.
